### 필수값 누락
POST http://localhost:4000/auth/signup 
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountType": "USER",
  "provider": "BASIC",
  "providerEmail": "test3@example.com",
  "nickname": "tester"
}

### 201 Pass
POST http://localhost:4000/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountType": "USER",
  "provider": "BASIC",
  "providerEmail": "test3@example.com",
  "password": "Password123",
  "nickname": "tester"
}

### 409 이미 존재하는 계정
POST http://localhost:4000/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountType": "USER",
  "provider": "BASIC",
  "providerEmail": "test3@example.com",
  "password": "Password123",
  "nickname": "tester"
}

### 501 아직 구현되지 않은 기능
POST http://localhost:4000/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountType": "PHOTOGRAPHER",
  "provider": "KAKAO",
  "providerToken": "",
  "nickname": "tester"
}

### 200 사용자 로그인
POST http://localhost:4000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "BASIC",
  "provider_email": "test3@example.com",
  "password": "Password123"
}

### 201 로그인한 사용자로 채팅방 생성 / 재시도 시 200
POST http://localhost:4000/chats
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 여기에 액세스토큰

{
  "photographerId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-b00200000101"
}